  "body": "All the tests we have pass even if we comment out `.catch(cancelSource)` on the `dest.write()` call in the pipeTo() impl. This is because any errors generated by `write()` will also be generated by `wait()`.\n\nI think we should remove that line, unless we can think of some edge case where it is useful.\n",
